{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45133","headline":"送梁拾遗肃归朝 · 皎然","name":"送梁拾遗肃归朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明主重文谏，才臣出江东。\n束书辞东山，改服临北风。\n万里望皇邑，九重当曙空。\n天开芙蓉阙，日上蒲桃宫。\n天子初未起，金闺籍先通。\n身逢轩辕世，名贵鸳鸾中。\n故人荣此别，何用悲丝桐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45133.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45133","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}